# Floor constraint for transitive dep - closes CVE-2026-21226 in azure-core 1.34.0/1.37.0.
# Not a direct runtime dep of melius-framework; brought in transitively by
# azure-eventhub, azure-identity, azure-kusto-data, azure-storage-*. Floor (>=)
# rather than exact pin so transitives can resolve a higher version naturally.
